#. Tag: refname
#, no-c-format
msgid "<refname>neochat</refname>"
msgstr "<refname>नियोचाट्</refname> इति"

#: man-neochat.1.docbook:30
#. Tag: refpurpose
#, no-c-format
msgid "Client for interacting with the matrix messaging protocol"
msgstr "मैट्रिक्स सन्देशप्रोटोकॉल इत्यनेन सह अन्तरक्रियायै ग्राहकः"

#: man-neochat.1.docbook:34
#. Tag: cmdsynopsis
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<command>neochat</command> <arg "
"choice=\"opt\"><replaceable>URI</replaceable></arg>"
msgstr ""
"<command>neochat</command> <arg "
"choice=\"opt\"><replaceable>URI</replaceable></arg> इति"

#: man-neochat.1.docbook:42
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Description"
msgstr "वर्णनम्‌"

#: man-neochat.1.docbook:43
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<command>neochat</command> is a chat application for the matrix protocol "
"that work on both desktop and mobile."
msgstr ""
"<command>neochat</command> इति मैट्रिक्सप्रोटोकॉलस्य कृते एकः "
"गपशप-अनुप्रयोगः अस्ति यः डेस्कटॉप् तथा मोबाईल् इत्येतयोः द्वयोः अपि कार्यं "
"करोति ।"

#: man-neochat.1.docbook:49
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Options"
msgstr "विकल्पाः"

#: man-neochat.1.docbook:52
#. Tag: option
#, no-c-format
msgid "<option>URI</option>"
msgstr "<option value=URI>प्रकारः</option>"

#: man-neochat.1.docbook:54
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The matrix uri for an user or a room. e.g matrix:u/user:example.org and "
"matrix:r/root:example.org. This will makes NeoChat try to open the given "
"room or conversation."
msgstr ""
"उपयोक्तुः कक्षस्य वा कृते आकृतिः उरी। यथा matrix:u/user:example.org तथा "
"matrix:r/root:example.org इति । एतेन NeoChat दत्तं कक्षं वा वार्तालापं वा "
"उद्घाटयितुं प्रयतते ।"

#: man-neochat.1.docbook:65
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Reporting bugs"
msgstr "दोषान् प्रतिवेदयति"

#: man-neochat.1.docbook:66
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can report bugs and feature requests at <ulink "
"url=\"https://bugs.kde.org/enter_bug.cgi?product=NeoChat&"
"amp;component=General\">https://bugs.kde.org/enter_bug.cgi?product=NeoChat&"
"amp;component=General</ulink>"
msgstr ""
"भवान् <ulink "
"url=\"https://bugs.kde.org/enter_bug.cgi?product=NeoChat&"
"amp;component=General\">https://bugs.kde.org/enter_bug.cgi? "
"product=नवचैट&amp;component=सामान्य</ulink>"

